イブが見られないことを非常に悔やんでおります。\n\n今回の依頼はその代わりといってはなんですが、龍が如く7における兄チャマのすき・シーンをご自由なチョイスで描いていただきたいというものです。\n自由というテーマの難しさを大変申し訳なくは思いますが、思い出に浸りつつゆるりと描いていただけましたら嬉しいです！\n\n旅に動画に配信にとお忙しいであろうところを恐縮ですが、ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 24, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "もとみやみつき＠11/1 FRAC2次創作全集配信＋抱き枕受注受付中", "screen_name": "frac_m", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1286733752161333248/0_sMMf1x.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/20958926/1656082716/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 1540388, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "素バタロ", "screen_name": "shiromeshi_no1", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1475835057957122049/pSS3R5ky.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 1906333, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "ほしねぎ", "screen_name": "neginoaoitokoro", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1475078480119627778/hAWuF4Db.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1445283567886426112/1736384516/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "c